# =========================================================
# Preserve Engineering Memory (COMMENTED OUT TO RESPECT CLEAN PROJECT CONSTRAINT)
# =========================================================
# The following files are now ignored by the general *.md pattern.
# !ENGINEERING_FREEZE.md
# !mutation_contracts.md
# !workspace_schema.md
# !task.md
# 
# !runtime/ARCHITECTURE_MAP.md
# !runtime/PLAN.md
# 
# !P7_IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md
# !P7_PHASE_COMPLETE.md
# !P7_README.md
# 
# !P8_5_IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md
# !P8_5_PHASE_COMPLETE.md
# 
# !LogAI.md

# =========================================================
# Markdown Files Constraint (All ignored except README.md)
# =========================================================
*.md
**/*.md
!README.md
!readme.md
!**/README.md
!**/readme.md

